      "text": "Facilities\nCDS (Shanghai) Facilities\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n❮\n\n\n❯\n\nCDS-1\n\nOur state-of-the-art teaching site features modern facilities, including cutting-edge lecture halls and classrooms that support premium education.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n❮\n\n\n❯\n\nStudy Area\n\nQuiet study lounges and collaborative seminar rooms to empower your research and academic discussion.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n❮\n\n\n❯\n\nSports & Recreation\n\nModern athletic facilities, including premium indoor gym spaces, basketball courts, and tennis courts, promote a healthy and balanced campus life.\n\nStudent Dormitory\n\nComfortable 2-student shared apartments featuring private individual bedrooms, equipped laundry access, and secure communal living spaces.\n\nCDS (Shanghai)\n\nAbout CDS (SH)\nShanghai Semester\nNews and Events\nStudy@Shanghai\nFAQs\nDelta+ Fellowship\nDelta X Fellowship\nAI Literacy (Shanghai)\nIntranet\nContact Us\nNo. 500 Fangchun Road, Pudong District, Shanghai\naskcds@hku.hk\n\nCopyright © 2026 School of Computing and Data Science, The University of Hong Kong. All rights reserved.",
